 <h3><u>Haq Ka Irfan</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p dir=ltr>haq ka irfaan jo paaya to ali yaad aaya<br> dil me quraan samaaya to ali yaad aaya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>aadam o nuh payambar ho ya hazrat isa<br> yunus o khizr ho ilyaas ya hazrat musa<br> waqt in par bhi jo aaya to ali yaad aaya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>ghar tha allah ka maujud makin koyi na tha<br> koyi aayega yahaan ye bhi yaqeen koyi na tha<br> dar jo diwaar me aaya to ali yaad aaya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>senkaro sur mathe aur pahelwaan hazaar<br> jo the khaibar me sabhi yaar magar mere yaar<br> mard ka zikr jab aaya to ali yaad aaya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>jism ek ek se do tukre baraabar dekhe<br> khun ki barsaat huwi urhte huwe sar dekhe<br> ran me abbas jab aaya to ali yaad</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>neza o tir o tabar kya koyi khanjar na mila<br> laakh dhundha kahi kuffar ka lashkar na mila<br> saaf maidaan nazar aaya to ali aaya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>apna kuch hosh na tha itni pareshaani thi<br> ghame dunya ne mujhe gher liya tha phir bhi<br> haath momin se milaaya to ali yaad aaya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>yun to mein rat ta raha saare sawaal aur jawaab<br> par naqirein ne turbat me mujhe behre hisaab<br> aa ke jis waqt jagaaya to ali yaad aaya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>zikr nabiyon ka suna khub ya ke baare digar<br> mein nuseri to nahi kheir se wallah magar<br> zikr allah ka aaya to ali yaad aaya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>jo ke aqwaale payambar ko bhulaa bethe the<br> ham ali ko bhi nahi jaante jo kehte the<br> un ko miti me dabaaya to ali yaad aaya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>qalbe baatil ko kayi tukron me bat te dekha<br> takht kya chiz hai darbaar ulat te dekha<br> khutba zainab ne sunaaya to ali yaad aaya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>shabe meraaj ajab baat huwi ya gohar<br> sun ke aawaaze khuda chonk uthe payghamabar<br> jab nazar kuch nahi aaya to ali yaad aaya</p> 
